{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40524,"sections":[{"id":"script-20524","name":"原始脚本 20524","scripts":[20524],"start":0,"count":33}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:1","scriptId":20524,"text":"波西娅的研究室中——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:2","scriptId":20524,"text":"兰布达正在清理埃普西隆目前的住所——玻璃缸。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":855,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:3","scriptId":20524,"text":"“这缩小的身体真是不方便，连我原本的能力都无法使用了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:4","scriptId":20524,"text":"“谁让你偷喝了我的收缩原液，那可是试制品……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":855,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:5","scriptId":20524,"text":"“那个确实是我的错……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":855,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:6","scriptId":20524,"text":"“但兰布达你是不是偷懒了？这次怎么那么久都还没弄出解药啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:7","scriptId":20524,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:8","scriptId":20524,"text":"兰布达沉默了一会儿，把头转向埃普西隆眯起了眼睛。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:9","scriptId":20524,"text":"埃普西隆见状立刻躲到了波西娅的茶杯后面，她探出半个身子说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":855,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:10","scriptId":20524,"text":"“怎么，被我说中了就恼羞成怒了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:11","scriptId":20524,"text":"“……你的身体好像有点变大了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:12","scriptId":20524,"text":"“哦！？真的吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":854,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:13","scriptId":20524,"text":"“也可能是我的错觉，你最近有做过什么奇怪的事情吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":854,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:14","scriptId":20524,"text":"兰布达用手指戳了戳埃普西隆的身体。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":854,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":855,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:15","scriptId":20524,"text":"“奇怪的事情？唔……好像没有，除了吃就是睡。哦！对了！我一直有偷吃波西娅的维修设备。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:16","scriptId":20524,"text":"“嗯？难道是那个？你知道自己是吃了哪个设备吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":855,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:17","scriptId":20524,"text":"“2挺轻机枪、3挺重机枪、还有什么输弹机、铁管子、装甲板、方盒子，纸卷之类的……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:18","scriptId":20524,"text":"“你到底偷吃了多少东西……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":855,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:19","scriptId":20524,"text":"“嘿嘿～这点不算什么～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":854,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:20","scriptId":20524,"text":"这时候一只大手从天而降，抓住了埃普西隆的脑袋并将她揪了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":854,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:21","scriptId":20524,"text":"“好大的胆子，竟然敢偷吃我放在研究室里的东西？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":854,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:22","scriptId":20524,"text":"不知道从哪儿冒出来的波西娅显然已经听到了埃普西隆和兰布达刚才的对话。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":854,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":853,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:23","scriptId":20524,"text":"（兰布达，你怎么不告诉我波西娅进来了啊！？）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":853,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:24","scriptId":20524,"text":"（抱歉，刚才在想事情，没注意。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":853,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":853,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:25","scriptId":20524,"text":"（这下我可惨了！）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":853,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:26","scriptId":20524,"text":"“怎么你们两个突然就没声音了？刚才不还聊得好好的嘛～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":853,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:27","scriptId":20524,"text":"“要恢复埃普西隆的身体，我觉得有必要让她再多吃一点设备。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:28","scriptId":20524,"text":"“嗯嗯，但设备可都是钱啊，我没理由白白送你们钱吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:29","scriptId":20524,"text":"“那……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:30","scriptId":20524,"text":"“我倒是有个可以随便差遣的人选，就让他给你们收集一些零散的设备和图纸好了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:31","scriptId":20524,"text":"“哦？没想到波西娅你还挺上道的嘛～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":854,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:32","scriptId":20524,"text":"“等你的身体恢复了，我就可以开始测试旅行者的身体强度了，之前只有兰布达一个样本，我怕搞坏她～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":854,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":853,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20524:20524:33","scriptId":20524,"text":"“…………诶！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":853,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
